                 &lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                   =
             &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                      =
          &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                          =
          &lt;p&gt;After that, click the OK button.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                       =
                                         &lt;/li&gt;=0A                          =
                                      &lt;li&gt;=0A                              =
                                      &lt;p&gt;Then, the Devices and Printers fol=
der will open.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                      =
          &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                         =
       &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                             =
       &lt;p&gt;Next, your screen will display the Add Printer option.=0A        =
                                                            &lt;/p&gt;=0A        =
                                                        &lt;/li&gt;=0A           =
                                                     &lt;li&gt;=0A               =
                                                     &lt;p&gt;Click the Add Print=
er button and follow the prompts.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                   =
                             &lt;/li&gt;=0A=0A                                   =
                         &lt;/ul&gt;=0A                                          =
              &lt;/div&gt;=0A=0A                                                 =
       &lt;div class=3D&quot;shadow cardbackgroundcolor p-3 my-3 setformac&quot;&gt;=0A    =
                                                        &lt;h3 class=3D&quot;mt-2 m=
y-3 text-primary&quot;&gt;Wi-Fi / Wireless setup (Mac)&lt;/h3&gt;=0A                     =
                                       &lt;ul class=3D&quot;scannerissuelisting p-0=
&quot;&gt;=0A                                                                &lt;li&gt;=
=0A                                                                    &lt;p&gt;F=
irstly, you will need to turn on the Mac device and=0A                     =
                                                   printer.&lt;/p&gt;=0A         =
                                                       &lt;/li&gt;=0A            =
                                                    &lt;li&gt;=0A                =
                                                    &lt;p&gt;Next, connect the pr=
inter to the wireless network.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                      =
                          &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                         =
                       &lt;li&gt;=0A                                             =
                       &lt;p&gt;Now, go to the official page and download the pri=
nter=0A                                                                    =
    driver.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                         =
       &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                            =
    &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                                =
    &lt;p&gt;Then, complete the driver installation process.&lt;/p&gt;=0A              =
                                                  &lt;/li&gt;=0A                 =
                                               &lt;li&gt;=0A                     =
                                               &lt;p&gt;After that, go to the App=
le Menu.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                            =
    &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                               =
 &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                                   =
 &lt;p&gt;In the menu, you have to click the System and Preferences=0A           =
                                                             option.&lt;/p&gt;=0A=
                                                                &lt;/li&gt;=0A   =
                                                             &lt;li&gt;=0A       =
                                                             &lt;p&gt;On the next=
 screen, select the Printers and Scanners=0A                               =
                                         option.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                    =
                                            &lt;/li&gt;=0A                       =
                                         &lt;li&gt;=0A                           =
                                         &lt;p&gt;Thereafter, you need to click t=
he =E2=80=9C+=E2=80=9D sign and add the=0A                                 =
                                       printer.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                     =
                                           &lt;/li&gt;=0A                        =
                                        &lt;li&gt;=0A                            =
                                        &lt;p&gt;From the pop-up window, choose y=
our printer.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                        =
        &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                           =
     &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                               =
     &lt;p&gt;Then, tap on the Add button.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                =
                                &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                   =
